# 物理隔离云端服务私钥和配置（绝对不允许上传）
push.json
sync.json
*.apk

# Firebase / FCM 配置文件：本地忽略，EAS 云端构建通过 EAS Secret 文件注入
# 上传方式：eas secret:create --scope project --name GOOGLE_SERVICES_JSON --type file --value ./google-services.json
#           eas secret:create --scope project --name GOOGLE_SERVICE_INFO_PLIST --type file --value ./GoogleService-Info.plist
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist